PROJECT PROFILE: NEXUS-SCM (Supply Chain Digital Twin & Command Center)

1. Backend State (FastAPI + PostgreSQL + Confluent Kafka)

Architecture: High-throughput microservice architecture.
Layer 5 (Optimized Ingestion): 

api/routes_ingestion.py
 runs non-blocking async REST ingestion. Incoming 

TelemetryEvent
 payloads immediately trigger 

send_event
 and return 202 Accepted without awaiting the DB. 

data_pipeline/kafka_producer.py
 is fully async (synchronous .poll() and .flush() blockers were removed).
Layer 4 (Optimized Data Sync): 

data_pipeline/kafka_consumer.py
 implements high-speed Micro-Batching (500 records or 2.0s triggers). It performs bulk INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE operations using raw SQLAlchemy 2.0 compiler vectors and raw Postgres statements to eliminate procedural ORM bottlenecks. Heavily wrapped in try/except/rollback atomic blocks.
PostgreSQL Pool: 

core/database.py
 is configured with pool_size=20 and max_overflow=10 to comfortably handle the micro-batch writes alongside simultaneous frontend read polling.
